    "body": "@upsuper, we should also consider `<li>` inside `<details>` such as\n\n``` html\n    <ol>\n      <li>\n        <details open><summary></summary><li></li></details>\n      </li>\n      <li></li>\n    </ol>\n```\n\nI think this should generate:\n\n```\n1. ▼ \n2.\n3.\n```\n",
