    "updated_at": "2016-03-28T04:52:24Z",
    "body": "No. Why should it be like that? According to the HTML spec, `<li>` should not appear inside `<details>` at all.\n\nIn addition, doing what you proposed may unnecessarily add the complexity, e.g. what should happen when the `<details>` is not open? Should the number be reserved?\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
